  "operations": "Read-only source/GET inspection, no request creation, mail, acceptance, cancellation, role or fixture mutation.",
  "contracts": [
    "Normal business owner required by transfer policy; business Administrator differs, menu visibility alone does not authorize transfer.",
    "Members tab/actual selected existing teammate versus Teams/routing; accepted ordinary membership required.",
    "GET confirmation is inert; password and Continue POST create owner invitation with one-week expiry, replace other owner invitations, and enqueue async mail.",
    "Pending owner invitation and current owner remain until acceptance; link requires matching confirmed recipient account, pending/unexpired invitation, explicit PATCH acceptance.",
    "Current accept implementation updates only recipient privilege to owner; no removal/downgrade of earlier owner privilege was found. Do not promise exclusive ownership or automatic previous-access revocation. Verify roles/sole owner with Support before treating handover complete.",
    "Pending badge uses pending invitations without expiry filter; expiry blocks acceptance but need not remove badge.",
    "Cancel menu opens confirmation; DELETE removes pending request, not a completed owner role; new/retry request must first reconcile uncertain state.",
    "No pending email/request/acceptance/cancel/result screenshot fabricated; owner and all member roles remain unchanged."
  ]
}
